<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>英语-VICE</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 16:05:27 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>为什么这位 R&amp;amp;B 传奇人物相信 Lady Gaga 是“文化秃鹰”</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/why-this-rb-legend-believes-that-lady-gaga-is-a-culture-vulture/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;R&amp;amp;B 传奇人物斯蒂芬妮·米尔斯 (Stephanie Mills) 称 Lady Gaga 为“文化秃鹰”，并回忆起多年前与她的一次特别冰冷的互动。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/why-this-rb-legend-believes-that-lady-gaga-is-a-culture-vulture/"&gt;为什么这位 R&amp;amp;B 传奇人物相信 Lady Gaga 是一位“文化秃鹰”，&lt;/a&gt;这篇文章首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 15:31:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/why-this-rb-legend-believes-that-lady-gaga-is-a-culture-vulture/</guid></item><item><title>史努比狗狗的女儿凭借“Doggyland”角色实现了在儿童动画中配音的毕生梦想</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/snoop-doggs-daughter-fulfills-life-long-dream-of-voice-acting-in-childrens-animation-with-doggyland-role/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;史努比狗狗 (Snoop Dogg) 的女儿加入了他的 YouTube 儿童动画片《Doggyland》的配音阵容，饰演一只时髦、自信的拉布拉多犬。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/snoop-doggs-daughter-fulfills-life-long-dream-of-voice-acting-in-childrens-animation-with-doggyland-role/"&gt;史努比狗狗的女儿以“Doggyland”角色实现了在儿童动画中配音的毕生梦想，&lt;/a&gt;该帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 15:27:50 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/snoop-doggs-daughter-fulfills-life-long-dream-of-voice-acting-in-childrens-animation-with-doggyland-role/</guid></item><item><title>莎朗·奥斯本最终解释了为什么梅加迪斯被排除在奥兹最后一场音乐会之外</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/sharon-osbourne-f